        <mxCell id="n15" value="1 — Phase 2 delivers the store, the admission rules, the risk seam and the assembled binary; both later phases build on it.&#10;2 — no Room can show ego's own view of vehicle B until the detector is inside the node image, so Phase 3's image step gates every Room.&#10;3 — the account allows two deployments at once and four groups want them, so this node's two Rooms run one after the other.&#10;Right of barrier 3 Phase 3 is still open: its last three readings are taken off the log Phase 4's first Room produced." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e5ea;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=15.4;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="496" width="1120" height="93.6" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
